# ENCODING plus the following additional detailed array configuration 
# parameters: QD_PRIMARY_ARRAY, PRIMARY_ARRAY and MIRROR_ARRAY.

# You can generate a sample detailed array configuration file as follows:
# gpinitsystem -c gp_init_config -O detailed_config_sample


